<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1922949767"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1609057506"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Illumination"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="斉藤朱夏"/><amll:meta key="album" value="hem"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:19.559"><div begin="00:00.538" end="03:19.699"><p begin="00:00.538" end="00:02.452" itunes:key="L795">サンライズ＆ムーンライズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n ra i zu ＆ mu u n ra i zu</span></p><p begin="00:02.518" end="00:04.299" itunes:key="L796">キミを照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照耀着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo te ra su</span></p><p begin="00:04.365" end="00:07.871" itunes:key="L797">混じり合う情熱で踊れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随着交织的热情 纵情起舞吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ji ri a u jo u ne tsu de o do re</span></p><p begin="00:08.001" end="00:09.888" itunes:key="L798">サンシャイン＆ムーンライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n sha i n ＆ mu u n ra i to</span></p><p begin="00:09.961" end="00:11.731" itunes:key="L799">未来を照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照耀着未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo te ra su</span></p><p begin="00:11.748" end="00:16.133" itunes:key="L800">二人の世界はイルミネーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于我们的世界 绚烂缤纷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri no se ka i ha i ru mi ne e sho n</span></p><p begin="00:15.944" end="00:16.173" itunes:key="L801">Let's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我一起奔赴未来 向着光明的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dive into the future</span></p><p begin="00:16.222" end="00:23.121" itunes:key="L802">Dive into the future 光の先へ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dive into the future</span></p><p begin="00:22.419" end="00:23.989" itunes:key="L803">迷わずにTake it high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再迷茫 让心情雀跃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo wa zu ni take it high</span></p><p begin="00:23.253" end="00:31.539" itunes:key="L804">Dive into the future まだ見ぬ景色を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起奔赴未来吧 向着还未亲见的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dive into the future</span></p><p begin="00:29.755" end="00:31.548" itunes:key="L805">どこまでもFly to high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">领略未知的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo fly to high</span></p><p begin="00:33.425" end="00:36.748" itunes:key="L806">誰もが羨むほどコンシャスなBody Line<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任谁都会不禁羡慕的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo ga u ra ya mu ho do</span></p><p begin="00:37.110" end="00:40.711" itunes:key="L807">Toxicに揺れるハイスペックなビーナスライン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在令人沉醉的美好风景中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Toxic ni yu re ru</span></p><p begin="00:40.804" end="00:42.637" itunes:key="L808">シックでカラフルでハイセンス<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的身姿潇洒 高贵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi 'k ku de ka ra fu ru de ha i se n su</span></p><p begin="00:42.679" end="00:47.895" itunes:key="L809">冷静ときどき子供のような笑顔任せて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的心交给我时而冷静</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">re i se i to ki do ki</span></p><p begin="00:47.905" end="00:48.608" itunes:key="L810">Hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">妩媚热辣的女孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hey foxy de su pa i shi i na ga a ru</span></p><p begin="00:48.643" end="00:50.386" itunes:key="L811">Foxyでスパイシーなガール<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hey foxy de su pa i shi i na ga a ru</span></p><p begin="00:50.556" end="00:52.246" itunes:key="L812">クールでパッションガール<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">潇洒热情的女孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku u ru de pa 's sho n ga a ru</span></p><p begin="00:52.328" end="00:55.377" itunes:key="L813">よそ見してたらお仕置きよ覚悟しなさい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你错开视线 就会受到惩罚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo so mi shi te ta ra o shi o ki yo</span></p><p begin="00:55.419" end="00:56.043" itunes:key="L814">Hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做好觉悟吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hey fancy de showy na ga a ru</span></p><p begin="00:56.077" end="00:57.923" itunes:key="L815">FancyでShowyなガール<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">引人注目的耀眼女孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hey fancy de showy na ga a ru</span></p><p begin="00:57.957" end="00:59.750" itunes:key="L816">ポジティブでパッションガール<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向上有激情的女孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po ji ti bu de pa 's sho n ga a ru</span></p><p begin="00:59.800" end="01:03.097" itunes:key="L817">愛だけに愛が止まらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你满载的爱意 已无法按捺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i da ke ni a i ga to ma ra na i</span></p><p begin="01:03.344" end="01:05.272" itunes:key="L818">サンライズ＆ムーンライズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n ra i zu ＆ mu u n ra i zu</span></p><p begin="01:05.398" end="01:07.070" itunes:key="L819">キミを照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照耀着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo te ra su</span></p><p begin="01:07.084" end="01:10.776" itunes:key="L820">混じり合う情熱で踊れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随着交织的热情 纵情起舞吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ji ri a u jo u ne tsu de o do re</span></p><p begin="01:10.782" end="01:12.570" itunes:key="L821">サンシャイン＆ムーンライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n sha i n ＆ mu u n ra i to</span></p><p begin="01:12.589" end="01:14.494" itunes:key="L822">未来を照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照耀着未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo te ra su</span></p><p begin="01:14.520" end="01:18.860" itunes:key="L823">二人の世界はイルミネーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于我们的世界 绚烂缤纷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri no se ka i ha i ru mi ne e sho n</span></p><p begin="01:18.536" end="01:18.881" itunes:key="L824">Let's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我一起奔赴未来 向着光明的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dive into the future</span></p><p begin="01:18.883" end="01:25.931" itunes:key="L825">Dive into the future 光の先へ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dive into the future</span></p><p begin="01:25.139" end="01:26.827" itunes:key="L826">迷わずにTake it high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再迷茫 让心情雀跃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo wa zu ni take it high</span></p><p begin="01:26.139" end="01:34.462" itunes:key="L827">Dive into the future まだ見ぬ景色を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起奔赴未来吧 向着还未亲见的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dive into the future</span></p><p begin="01:32.554" end="01:34.462" itunes:key="L828">どこまでもFly to high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">领略未知的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo fly to high</span></p><p begin="01:36.153" end="01:39.768" itunes:key="L829">難攻不落なステージ 攻略はKeep your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身处难以攻陷的阶段</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n ko u fu ra ku na su te e ji</span></p><p begin="01:39.842" end="01:43.452" itunes:key="L830">レッスンでアドバンテージ 努力は裏切らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挑战这一课题</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">re 's su n de a do ba n te e ji</span></p><p begin="01:43.549" end="01:45.307" itunes:key="L831">朝からFeel like dancin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从早上开始 心情就像舞动般雀跃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa ka ra feel like dancin'</span></p><p begin="01:45.508" end="01:50.524" itunes:key="L832">情熱ときどき大人の仕草も任せて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把你的心交给我时而热情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">jo u ne tsu to ki do ki</span></p><p begin="01:50.723" end="01:51.341" itunes:key="L833">Hey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是只属于我的风格</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hey wa ta shi da ke no style</span></p><p begin="01:51.351" end="01:53.156" itunes:key="L834">私だけのStyle<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Hey wa ta shi da ke no style</span></p><p begin="01:53.300" end="01:55.042" itunes:key="L835">振り向かずにTry<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再回头 努力尝试吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ri mu ka zu ni try</span></p><p begin="01:55.100" end="01:58.197" itunes:key="L836">夢だけは夢じゃ終われない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只存在于梦中的梦想 是不会实现的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me da ke ha yu me ja o wa re na i</span></p><p begin="01:58.792" end="02:00.571" itunes:key="L837">サンライズ＆ムーンライズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n ra i zu ＆ mu u n ra i zu</span></p><p begin="02:00.633" end="02:02.477" itunes:key="L838">キミを包む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">包裹着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo tsu tsu mu</span></p><p begin="02:02.527" end="02:06.184" itunes:key="L839">響きあう鼓動で歌え<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随着我们共鸣的心跳 高歌吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi bi ki a u ko do u de u ta e</span></p><p begin="02:06.199" end="02:07.972" itunes:key="L840">サンシャイン＆ムーンライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n sha i n ＆ mu u n ra i to</span></p><p begin="02:08.018" end="02:09.834" itunes:key="L841">奇跡が待つ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奇迹在等待着我们</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki se ki ga ma tsu</span></p><p begin="02:09.935" end="02:14.530" itunes:key="L842">高まる想いはイルミネーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断高涨充斥的心意 绚烂缤纷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ka ma ru o mo i ha i ru mi ne e sho n</span></p><p begin="02:20.515" end="02:22.116" itunes:key="L843">Everybody make me shine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们令我的身形光彩耀人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Everybody make me shine</span></p><p begin="02:22.117" end="02:25.413" itunes:key="L844">誰も知らない私<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无人知晓的一面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re mo shi ra na i wa ta shi</span></p><p begin="02:25.712" end="02:30.884" itunes:key="L845">君だけに見せてあげるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只会展现在你眼前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi da ke ni mi se te a ge ru yo</span></p><p begin="02:32.107" end="02:33.854" itunes:key="L846">サンライズ＆ムーンライズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n ra i zu ＆ mu u n ra i zu</span></p><p begin="02:33.912" end="02:35.749" itunes:key="L847">キミを照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照耀着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi wo te ra su</span></p><p begin="02:35.795" end="02:39.449" itunes:key="L848">混じり合う情熱で踊れ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随着交织的热情 纵情起舞吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ji ri a u jo u ne tsu de o do re</span></p><p begin="02:39.495" end="02:41.203" itunes:key="L849">サンシャイン＆ムーンライト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阳光＆月光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n sha i n ＆ mu u n ra i to</span></p><p begin="02:41.281" end="02:43.084" itunes:key="L850">未来を照らす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照耀着未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo te ra su</span></p><p begin="02:43.095" end="02:47.786" itunes:key="L851">二人の世界はイルミネーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">属于我们的世界 绚烂缤纷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta ri no se ka i ha i ru mi ne e sho n</span></p><p begin="02:47.289" end="02:47.507" itunes:key="L852">Let's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我一起奔赴未来 向着光明的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dive into the future</span></p><p begin="02:47.585" end="02:54.618" itunes:key="L853">Dive into the future 光の先へ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dive into the future</span></p><p begin="02:53.668" end="02:55.273" itunes:key="L854">迷わずにTake it high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再迷茫 让心情雀跃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo wa zu ni take it high</span></p><p begin="02:54.632" end="03:01.988" itunes:key="L855">Dive into the future まだ見ぬ景色を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起奔赴未来吧 向着还未亲见的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dive into the future</span></p><p begin="03:01.209" end="03:02.602" itunes:key="L856">どこまでもFly to high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">领略未知的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo fly to high</span></p><p begin="03:02.148" end="03:09.348" itunes:key="L857">Dive into the future 光の先へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我一起奔赴未来 向着光明的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dive into the future</span></p><p begin="03:08.548" end="03:10.085" itunes:key="L858">迷わずにTake it high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再迷茫 让心情雀跃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo wa zu ni take it high</span></p><p begin="03:09.446" end="03:17.414" itunes:key="L859">Dive into the future まだ見ぬ景色を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起奔赴未来吧 向着还未亲见的光景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Dive into the future</span></p><p begin="03:15.901" end="03:17.614" itunes:key="L860">どこまでもFly to high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">领略未知的景色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo fly to high</span></p><p begin="03:18.591" end="03:19.699" itunes:key="L861">Let's dive!!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我一起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Let's dive</span></p></div></body></tt>